<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">
	<PropertyGroup>
		<Description>Norse.AuthN.Services: the IAuthenticationService gRPC contract and its wire request records (LoginRequest, RegisterRequest, EmailExistsRequest, TwoFactorSignInRequest, RecoveryCodeSignInRequest, ForgotPasswordRequest, ResetPasswordRequest, ConfirmEmailRequest, ConfirmEmailChangeRequest, ResendEmailConfirmationRequest — responses are Asgard's NavigationResult/BoolResponse under Outcome&lt;T&gt;; no result record lives here), plus the IIdentityService disclosure contract and its wire records (GetMyPersonalDataRequest, GetMaskedPersonalDataRequest, PersonalDataResponse, MaskedPersonalDataResponse), the IAccountService self-service account contract and its wire records (AccountStatusResponse, SetPhoneNumberRequest, ChangePasswordRequest, SetPasswordRequest, ChangeEmailRequest, ExternalLoginsResponse, ExternalLoginEntry, ExternalProviderEntry, RemoveExternalLoginRequest, DeletePersonalDataRequest), the Train 3 contracts and their wire records — ITwoFactorService (AuthenticatorSetupResponse, EnableAuthenticatorRequest, RevealRecoveryCodesRequest, RecoveryCodesResponse), IPasskeyService (PasskeysResponse, PasskeyEntry, GetPasskeyRequest, PasskeyCreationOptionsResponse, AddPasskeyRequest, RenamePasskeyRequest, RemovePasskeyRequest) and ISignInMethodsService (GetSignInMethodsRequest, SignInMethodsResponse, ExternalProviderLink, PasskeyRequestOptionsResponse, PasskeySignInRequest) — and the IdentityPolicies/AuthNPolicies policy-name constants — no mediator marker, no [Authorize], no Razor, no FluentValidation, no Blazilla. Logout, GetAccountStatus, GetExternalLogins, and the request-less two-factor/passkey operations are CancellationToken-only; there is no LogoutRequest. A consumer who wants the gRPC declarations without AuthN.Components' Razor components references only this assembly, wraps its own UI around these contracts, and wires it to whatever backend it sees fit.</Description>
		<NorseFrontendPlatforms>All</NorseFrontendPlatforms>
	</PropertyGroup>
	<ItemGroup>
		<NorseRef Include="Abstractions.Components">
			<Repo>Asgard</Repo>
		</NorseRef>
		<NorseRef Include="Abstractions.Contracts">
			<Repo>Asgard</Repo>
		</NorseRef>
		<PackageReference Include="Microsoft.AspNetCore.Authorization" Version="11.*-*" />
		<PackageReference Include="System.ServiceModel.Primitives" Version="10.*" />
	</ItemGroup>
</Project>
